exportChequesCsv=function(cheques=accountingCheques()){const quote=value=>`"${String(value??'').replace(/"/g,'""')}"`,rows=[['Encomenda/Fatura','Número do cheque','Data de vencimento','Dias restantes','Estado'],...cheques.map(item=>[item.documentNumber,item.chequeNumber,item.dueDate?new Date(`${item.dueDate}T12:00:00`).toLocaleDateString('pt-PT'):'',item.daysRemaining??'',item.statusLabel||accountingStateLabel(accountingChequeState(item))])],csv='\ufeff'+rows.map(row=>row.map(quote).join(';')).join('\r\n'),blob=new Blob([csv],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}),url=URL.createObjectURL(blob),link=document.createElement('a');link.href=url;link.download=`cheques-${accountingFilter}-${isoDate(new Date())}.csv`;link.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000)};
